flowchart TB
    Bot([Bot: JSON and Idempotency-Key]) --> Access{Authorized?}
    Access -->|No| Deny[401, 403 or 404]
    Access -->|Yes| Key{Request key exists?}
    Key -->|Different request| Conflict[409 idempotency_conflict]
    Key -->|Same request| Existing[Existing job + SHA]
    Key -->|New key| Ref[Resolve ref to SHA]
    Ref --> Job[Create queued job; 202]
    Existing --> Poll[GET status]
    Job --> Poll
    Poll --> State{State}
    State -->|In progress| Wait[Poll again after delay]
    Wait --> Poll
    State -->|failed| Error[Code + diagnostics]
    State -->|succeeded| PDF[GET private PDF]
    PDF --> Result([PDF + SHA])
